# --- RStudio / R session state (per-machine, never commit) ---
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.Ruserdata
*.RData
Rplots.pdf
inst/doc

# --- agent / worktree tooling (kept local) ---
.claude/worktrees/
.claire/

# --- case studies ---
