# hash. The rendered notebook.md and its figures ARE committed: they are the point.
case_studies/**/data/

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store

# --- session / agent scratch (never public) ---
*_SESSION_PROMPT.md
NEXT_SESSION*.md
CRAN-SUBMISSION
